$$

- Inventory availability (cannot exceed initial inventory):
$$
x_i \leq s_i \quad \forall i \in I
$$

- Nonnegativity and integrality:
$$
x_i \in \mathbb{Z}_{\geq 0} \quad \forall i \in I
$$

